86 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 26 0 R/T(how work is assigned to them \(block, round-robin or dynamic distribution\). For CA-3, the failure is framed as an intentionally defective user-space task scheduler: it divides a cost-skewed task list into contiguous equal-count blocks. Equal task counts do not imply equal work. Because the first 10% of tasks are ten times more expensive, a contiguous partition places a disproportionate amount of work in the first worker's block. The other workers may finish sooner and remain idle while the slowest worker determines total completion time.)/E(how work is assigned to them \(block, round-robin or dynamic distribution\). For CA-3, the failure is framed as an intentionally defective user-space task scheduler: it divides a cost-skewed task list into contiguous equal-count blocks. Equal task counts do not imply equal work. Because the first 10% of tasks are ten times more expensive, a contiguous partition places a disproportionate amount of work in the first worker's block. The other workers may finish sooner and remain idle while the slowest worker determines total completion time.)/Pg 12 0 R/K[14]>>
endobj

