endobj

114 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 27 0 R/T(Affinity can interact with this imbalance. Pinning a worker restricts its placement and can prevent migration to another allowed CPU. However, affinity alone does not cause the original partition imbalance; the task assignment policy is the direct cause.)/E(Affinity can interact with this imbalance. Pinning a worker restricts its placement and can prevent migration to another allowed CPU. However, affinity alone does not cause the original partition imbalance; the task assignment policy is the direct cause.)/Pg 13 0 R/K[6]>>
endobj

