403 0 obj
<</Title(The repair compares round-robin static assignment and a dynamic shared task queue. The experiment also retains the three affinity modes from the research paper: none \(default Linux placement\), spread \(one distinct allowed CPU per worker\), and single \(all workers restricted to one allowed CPU as a control\). The program checks that every task is completed exactly once and records real measurements to CSV.)/Dest[12 0 R/Fit]/Parent 361 0 R/Prev 414 0 R/Next 392 0 R>>
endobj

